--- 6. mount AVAILABILITY, which is not the same as capacity ---
    node_exporter stops exporting node_filesystem_* for a mountpoint the
    moment it is unmounted - the series does not go to zero, it ceases to
    exist. So availability is monitored with absent(), not a threshold.
    absent(node_filesystem_size_bytes{mountpoint="/mnt/xfs"}) = <empty, i.e. mount present>
